# Optional — only if the API is on a different domain than the React app.
# Same-domain deploy (recommended): leave unset; the app uses /api via your host proxy.
# Split deploy example:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.yourdomain.com
#
# Hybrid (Capacitor): npm run cap:sync && npm run android
# To wrap a live HTTPS site, add server.url in capacitor.config.json.
# Bundled APK: set VITE_API_BASE to the public API origin, then npm run cap:sync.
